# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Contact form delivery (frontend-only, no backend required)
#
# The site posts form submissions straight from the browser to Web3Forms,
# which emails them to the inbox tied to each access key.
#
# Setup (5 minutes, free tier is enough):
#   1. Go to https://web3forms.com
#   2. Enter connect@rupeeco.in  -> confirm the email -> copy the access key
#      into NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY_CONNECT below
#   3. Repeat for support@rupeeco.in and director@rupeeco.in
#   4. Add all three in Vercel: Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables
#
# Only CONNECT is required. If SUPPORT or DIRECTOR are missing, those
# enquiries fall back to the CONNECT inbox. If none are set, the form
# degrades to opening a prefilled email in the visitor's mail client.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY_CONNECT=
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY_SUPPORT=
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY_DIRECTOR=
